# A line drawn with the mouse, selected, and nudged a pixel right and
# ten up with Shift; the same as path_nudge.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalenceNudge).
key s
move 200 250
down L 200 250
up L 200 250
move 350 250
down L 350 250
up L 350 250
key esc
move 275 250
down L 275 250
up L 275 250
key right
key up shift
